@startuml
title VEL Evidence Layer Architecture

package "Evidence Sources" {
  [OS / Middleware]
  [HW Metrics]
  [S-CORE Modules]
}

package "VEL" {
  [Source Collectors]
  [NodeAgent]
  [Vehicle Evidence Output]
}

package "Configuration" {
  [Input Interface Definitions]
  [Output Evidence Definitions]
  [Normalization Mappings]
}

package "External" {
  [Designated Evidence Consumer]
}

[OS / Middleware] --> [Source Collectors] : runtime states
[HW Metrics] --> [Source Collectors] : accessible metrics
[S-CORE Modules] --> [Source Collectors] : module states
[Input Interface Definitions] --> [Source Collectors]
[Source Collectors] --> [NodeAgent] : source records
[Normalization Mappings] --> [NodeAgent]
[NodeAgent] --> [Vehicle Evidence Output] : normalized evidence
[Output Evidence Definitions] --> [Vehicle Evidence Output]
[Vehicle Evidence Output] --> [Designated Evidence Consumer]

note right of [NodeAgent]
Collection, normalization,
quality, and VEL health
end note
@enduml
